| Tag | Students see (EN) | Students see (ZH) | Source folder |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| F01 | Quantities and units | 物理量與單位 | `quizzes/foundations-quantities/` |
| F02 | Useful mathematics in physics | 物理中常用的數學 | `quizzes/foundations-useful-math/` |

Students see the **topic name**, not the tag. Do not prefix F01/F02 on hub labels, quiz titles, or `quizData.js` section labels.

